            <div class="kicker">About</div>
            <h1>Builder, becoming a researcher.</h1>
            <p>19 years old, second-year AI Engineering student in Madrid, eighteen months of shipping agents in production, now re-orienting toward alignment and interpretability research. This site is the public version of that transition.</p>
          </div>
